WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.295
What the AED does.

00:00:01.295 --> 00:00:12.883
An AED reads the heart rhythm through its pads, decides whether a shock is needed, charges only for a shockable rhythm and guides the rescuer with voice prompts.

00:00:12.883 --> 00:00:16.625
Some devices also provide a compression-tempo count.
